tests/golden/check/ffi-constant-type.hero:15:30: error[ffi_constant_type]: an `extern constant` cannot be declared `str` — a `str` is built by this runtime, so no C header holds one: declare it `cstr` and read it with `validated`, which copies and may fail (§4.20)
tests/golden/check/ffi-constant-type.hero:19:19: error[ffi_constant_type]: an `extern constant` cannot be declared `()` — a `constant` names a value, and `()` is a type rather than a value
